OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day today with
OL,6,Fshowers, which may turn into a longer
OL,7,Fspell of rain for a time. Increasingly
OL,8,Fwindy with wind gusts perhaps reaching
OL,9,Fgale force near coasts and over hills.
OL,10,FFeeling cooler than of late.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying cloudy and windy this
OL,13,Fevening with some further spells of
OL,14,Frain. Winds easing overnight with rain
OL,15,Falso gradually fading.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FAny lingering rain generally
OL,18,Fclearing throughout the morning,
OL,19,Fleaving a largely dry afternoon with
OL,20,Fsome bright spells developing.
OL,21,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
